      "title": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Mixed --" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1001,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "This is a **fleet-wide overview** across all tenants — no `$tenant`/`$connector` selectors, since the point is to see everything at once. For a per-tenant/per-connector drill-down (processing time, cache hit rates, error rates), use the main **Dynamic Mapper — Observability** dashboard.\n\n**Active Tenants / Tenants table** are derived from `dynmapper_inbound_inventory_cache_size` — this gauge is created unconditionally for every tenant at subscription time (before any connector is configured or message flows) and removed on unsubscribe, making it the most reliable \"is this tenant currently deployed here\" signal available. All three cache-size gauges (inbound/outbound identity, inventory) behave the same way.\n\n**Deployed Version(s)** reads `dynmapper_build_info`, a gauge added specifically for this dashboard (always `1`, with the real version in the `version` tag — the standard Prometheus \"info\" pattern, since Micrometer has no native way to publish a plain string metric). **This requires the service to be redeployed with that change before any data appears.** If multiple rows show up with different versions, that's a live mixed-version rollout (or a genuinely stale metric from an instance that hasn't been scraped recently) — check the `instance` column.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 10,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Fleet Overview",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count(count by (tenant) (dynmapper_inbound_inventory_cache_size)) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "active tenants",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Active Tenants",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 7 },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count(dynmapper_connector_status) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "connectors configured",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Total Connectors Configured",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Fleet-wide — not scoped to one tenant. Alert on this being > 0.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "id": 13,
